    "A6-B": {
      "title": "Chart: Prophets and Kings of Judah and of Israel (Part 2)",
      "url": "https://www.jw.org/en/library/bible/nwt/appendix-a/kings-of-israel/",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Kings of the Southern Kingdom ( Continued )"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "777 B.C.E."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Jotham: 16 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "762"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Ahaz: 16 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "746"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hezekiah: 29 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "716"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Manasseh: 55 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "661"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Amon: 2 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "659"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Josiah: 31 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "628"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Jehoahaz: 3 months"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Jehoiakim: 11 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "618"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Jehoiachin: 3 months, 10 days"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "617"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Zedekiah: 11 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "607"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Jerusalem and its temple are destroyed by the invading Babylonians under Nebuchadnezzar. Zedekiah, the last earthly king in the Davidic line, is dethroned"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Kings of the Northern Kingdom ( Continued )"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "c. 803 B.C.E."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Zechariah: recorded reign of only 6 months"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Zechariah began to reign in some sense, but evidently the kingship was not fully confirmed as his until c. 792"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "c. 791"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Shallum: 1 month"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Menahem: 10 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "c. 780"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Pekahiah: 2 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "c. 778"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Pekah: 20 years"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "c. 758"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hoshea: 9 years from c. 748"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "c. 748"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "It seems that Hoshea’s rule became fully established or possibly received the backing of the Assyrian monarch Tiglath-pileser III in c. 748"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "740"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Assyria conquers Samaria, subjugates Israel; northern ten-tribe kingdom of Israel comes to its end"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
